<title>UK: Spintab adds 200 million marks to May 2001 FRN.</title>
<headline>Spintab adds 200 million marks to May 2001 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been increased, lead manager CSFB Effectenbank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SPINTAB AB</p>
<p> AMT ** 600 MLN DEM   SPREAD     10 BP     MATURITY    17.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE  * 25.SEP.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  100.175   FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    100.175</p>
<p> NOTES    * PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>	   ** ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 400 MLN DEM ON 29.JAN.96</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.10	LIST FEE    0.025</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
